Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">腾讯混元发布224B参数模型Hy4flash，支持1M上下文且解码超150tps</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">火山引擎正式开放Seedance2.54K API，支持10-bit色深与样片模式</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">华为云将于11月16日正式发布首款昇腾原生具身世界模型CloudRoboWM1.2</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">阿里发布 Qwen4-Max 大模型，通过架构升级实现单任务费用降低 58%</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/c2c303a274d7150ff31b1ad2950e6e10.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">阿里千问于 11 月 16 日正式发布 Qwen4-Max 大模型，该模型基于全新架构，总参数量 2.4T，每 token 激活 71B，并配备 328B N-gram Embedding 参数，支持百万 token 上下文及原生视觉能力。架构上，Qwen4-Max 引入 Gated DeltaNet 压缩历史状态、QSA 按块选取上下文及 Gated Residual 四分支并行结构，使每 token 激活参数减少约 25%。性能方面，该模型在 Work360 基准测试中获 52.69 分，且在多项任务中显著降低 token 消耗，单任务平均费用从 26.58 元降至 11.16 元，降幅达 58%。目前，Qwen4-Max 已上线千问 AI 平台提供 API 服务，缓存命中价格低至每百万 Tokens 0.</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">苹果首款AI智能眼镜代号N50，计划2027年WWDC发布并于年底上市</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/6966a0a6588676ea07ac46e8d14ff7b2.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">苹果计划于2027年6月WWDC全球开发者大会发布首款AI智能眼镜，内部代号N50，预计同年底正式上市。该产品硬件设计已定型，外观较Meta第二代Ray-Ban智能眼镜更纤薄，摄像头集成于镜框内。功能上，该设备不采用AR显示方案，而是以Siri为核心交互，通过摄像头感知环境，支持建筑识别、实时翻译及导航。用户可通过语音指令调用Siri识别食材、预订餐厅、呼叫网约车或购买票务，旨在减少对iPhone的依赖。苹果通过此产品探索将AI助手、环境感知与日常生活服务整合至轻量化可穿戴设备的全新交互形态，重点优化了音质、传感器配置及佩戴体验，并提供多种款式与配色选择。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">腾讯混元发布224B参数模型Hy4flash，支持1M上下文且解码超150tps</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/942a93eb407417564499d81456d142e9.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">腾讯混元于11月16日正式发布Hy4flash模型，该模型定位为高性价比日常办公助手，总参数量224B（含64B Engram参数），激活参数12B，支持多模态与1M上下文。技术架构上，通过混合注意力、LatentMoE与Engram架构优化，其KV cache仅为Hy4的1/6，推理端结合megakernel与4bit量化，解码速度突破150tps。在成本控制方面，Hy4flash单任务成本仅为Hy4preview的1/13，显著低于DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash-1017。目前该模型已在腾讯云TokenHub、WorkBuddy、元宝、企业微信等平台上线，即将接入OpenRouter。官方建议将其用于深度搜索、文档处理及PPT生成等日常任务，长程软件工程任务仍推荐使用Hy4。11月30日前，Work</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">火山引擎正式开放Seedance2.54K API，支持10-bit色深与样片模式</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/699c9a5483c702b3362fde66354c783a.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">11月16日，火山引擎宣布Seedance2.54K视频生成模型API全面开放，开发者与企业客户即日起可直接调用该模型，标志着4K级视频生成能力进入规模化接入阶段。Seedance2.54K作为Seedance2.5系列中能力最强的版本，针对人物表情、细微动作及画面细节进行了专项训练。在功能与画质上，该模型支持Draft（样片）模式，允许用户先以480P快速验证分镜，待效果确认后再生成4K正片，有效降低创意探索阶段的试错成本。同时，模型支持10-bit色深，能提供更丰富的色彩层次与平滑的渐变过渡，满足大荧幕呈现需求。此次API开放旨在通过兼顾画质、成本与工作流适配，推动4K视频生成技术在影视、广告等内容生产场景的落地应用。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">华为云将于11月16日正式发布首款昇腾原生具身世界模型CloudRoboWM1.2</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/a90bf93e01da3660ab6d877157ed4f12.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">华为云定于11月16日14:00举办线上发布会，正式推出首款昇腾原生具身世界模型CloudRoboWM1.2。该模型旨在加速具身智能技术从实验室研发向千行百业的规模化落地。发布会由华为云具身产品线总裁吴小东主持，具身智能Lab首席模型专家刘流将深度解读模型架构与核心能力，产业生态负责人丁志彬则会发布CloudRobo生态共建计划。作为华为云继2025年推出CloudRobo平台及2026年发布具身智能专区后的又一关键动作，CloudRoboWM1.2的发布标志着华为云在具身智能技术与产业生态布局上的进一步完善。此举将为国产昇腾算力与具身智能模型的深度协同提供重要支撑，推动具身智能产业化进程。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
